| ========================================================== |
| Test: Scope System (global, main, func, class) |
| ========================================================== |

| Global scope variable (only Import, FuncDecl, ClassDecl allowed at top level) |
**Import**($Random)@also%~random!`global`:random

| Function with local scope |
get_local() [
    int(999)~local_var
    <return>(local_var)
]

| Class with scope |
ScopeTest !class [
    @private [
        int(0)~class_val

        set_val(int~v) [
            <now>(v)>class_val
            <return>(class_val)
        ]

        get_val() [
            <return>(class_val)
        ]
    ]
]

| Main block |
[
    | Global scope: random module available |
    int(<$random>(1, 10))~global_rand
    <printf>^("Global random: {global_rand}\n")

    | Function local scope |
    int(~get_local())~local_result
    <printf>^("Local scope result: {local_result}\n")

    | Class scope |
    ~ScopeTest~st
    int($st~set_val(42))~set_result
    int($st~get_val())~get_result
    <printf>^("Class scope: set={set_result}, get={get_result}\n")

    | Verify global_rand is accessible in main |
    <printf>^("Global rand still accessible: {global_rand}\n")
]
